window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>Maddy used to think she knew what would end her life. Now, the list is too long to guess from.</p> <p>And possibly the most dangerous of them all—Kain.</p> <p>Every day she spends at Featherblade, more secrets are revealed, and it will only be so long before one of them is hers.</p> <p>When Kain has what he wants from her… She fears it won’t just be those who wronged him who will feel his wrath. </p> <p>She must be strong. She must earn her wings. She must resist the promise in his flaming eyes. She must not fall for the villain of Featherblade.</p> <p>Fae Vikings meets fantasy romance in this enemies-to-lovers series in an academy/war college setting. If you love villain-gets-the-girl stories and obsessive burn-the-world-down-for-her MMCs, then this is for you.</p> <p>The spice is deliciously slow-burn and builds with each book.</p>"; 
